# The root .gitignore excludes everything in here except `schema.sql` and
# `presets/`, so this file only has to guard what lands *inside* presets/.
#
# It cannot re-include anything: git never descends into an excluded
# directory, so a negation here would be dead. Re-inclusions live in the root
# .gitignore next to the `data/*` rule that causes the exclusion.

# Model weights never belong in git, wherever they land. They are large, and
# HY-MT1.5 ships under the Tencent HY Community Licence, which is not an
# open-source licence and restricts redistribution.
presets/**/*.gguf
presets/**/*.onnx
presets/**/*.safetensors
presets/**/*.npz

# Nor does media. Backgrounds and logos are small, deliberate, and worth
# diffing; a video that wandered into presets/ is neither.
presets/**/*.mp4
presets/**/*.wav
presets/**/*.mkv
